# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Drupal 11 Upgrade Toolkit — Environment Configuration
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your values:
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# The toolkit also reads from ~/.d11/.env and ~/.d11/ai.json, so you can
# store credentials centrally rather than per-project.
#
# All AI provider settings are OPTIONAL. The core upgrade workflow (scan,
# Composer update, database dump, rollback, visual regression) runs fully
# without any AI key. AI keys are only used when the Gate 1 audit identifies
# custom code that needs AI-assisted patch generation (action: ai_manual_patch).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────


# ── Google Gemini (Recommended — free tier available) ────────────────────────
# Get a free API key at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key-here
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash


# ── Anthropic Claude ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get an API key at: https://console.anthropic.com/
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your-anthropic-api-key-here
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022


# ── OpenAI ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get an API key at: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-api-key-here
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini


# ── Local Ollama (No API key needed — runs on your machine) ──────────────────
# Install Ollama from: https://ollama.com/
# OLLAMA_HOST=http://localhost:11434


# ── Default AI Provider ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Which provider to use when multiple are configured.
# Options: gemini | anthropic | openai | ollama
# DEFAULT_AI_PROVIDER=gemini


# ── Data Storage Location (Advanced) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Override where the toolkit stores run artifacts, database snapshots, and
# workflow locks. Defaults to ~/.d11 (fully portable across machines).
# D11_HOME=/path/to/your/d11/storage
